  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know how to prepare spells or extracts most of the way, and then finish the process at the last moment.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to prepare extracts or spells, ability to prepare [plan] talents or a similar ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As part of preparing this plan, you can leave a spell slot or extract unprepared. You can reveal this plan as a full-round action to finish preparing a spell or extract of that level that you could have prepared in an unprepared slot.</p>\n<p>This is considered to be a plan talent for the purposes of determining the number of plans you can prepare in a day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
